{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2022-11-08 17:56:00', 'title': 'AMEREN ILLINOIS ANNOUNCES PRICING OF GREEN FIRST MORTGAGE BONDS DUE 2052', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , NOV. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMEREN ILLINOIS COMPANY, A SUBSIDIARY OF AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE), ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF A PUBLIC OFFERING OF $350 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 5.90% FIRST MORTGAGE BONDS DUE 2052 AT 99.691% OF THEIR PRINCIPAL AMOUNT.\xa0 THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON NOV. 22, 2022, SUBJECT TO THE SATISFACTION OF CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}